0.01: First version (imported from personal OneDrive folder)
0.02: Group messages by conversation. WhatsApp message counts are ignored, so short names (e.g. 2 letters) group correctly
0.03: New layout: seconds dial (updated every second) with the status icon in its centre, smaller time font, song title across the top, artist next to the dial, rounded info bar
0.04: Battery level right-aligned so 100% fits in the info bar
0.05: Weather panel when no music is playing: temperature, sun position between sunrise and sunset, wind speed and direction, 24 h rain chance graph. Music area returns to the weather when music stops or stays paused for 10 minutes
0.06: Weather icon for the whole day next to the temperature; sun bar starts right after the temperature; rain graph no longer overlaps its labels at 100%
0.07: At night the sun bar becomes a night bar (sunset to next sunrise) with a moon
0.08: Rain graph uses the whole height of its box; removed the MAX label
0.09: New "mission clock" time panel (week number, day of the year, day progress bar) and info bar (day, date, battery %); time now shows a leading zero
0.10: Seconds dial inverted to match the other panels: black face, cyan frame and ticks, yellow pointer, cyan icons
0.11: Messages shown as three cards (app icon, unread count, sender, start of the last message); shorter day/date/battery panel; 1px gaps between panels
0.12: New status plate in the centre of the dial: octagon with a small symbol and a label (PLAY / HOLD / LOCK / LINK), replaces the large icons
0.13: Date bar redesigned: labels in the top border, larger values, day of the month and 3 letter month in separate cells
